id: beautiful-attire
name: Beautiful Attire
kind: crafting
slots: 1
# "A Skill of your choice (when creating this piece of Apparel) ... The Skill must use your
# Personality Score to be chosen."
chooses: skill
choiceAttribute: personality
prerequisites: Personality Score of 4+
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Personality Skill chosen when it is made: its Checks 2 higher. Needs a Personality Score of
  4+ in whoever wears it.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: Increase your Dice Score on Skill Checks with a Skill of your choice (when creating
  this piece of Apparel) by 2. The Skill must use your Personality Score to be chosen.
text: >
  Beautiful Attire: This outfit is visually appealing, enhancing your performance in social
  situations.
  –Apparel Category: All
  –Prerequisites: Personality Score of 4+
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: Increase your Dice Score on Skill Checks with a Skill of your choice (when creating
  this piece of Apparel) by 2. The Skill must use your Personality Score to be chosen.

---

# The Skill is asked when the Quality is added, among those that use the Personality Score,
# and kept with it. "Your Dice Score on Skill Checks": the roll, not the Skill Bonus.
#
# Only while the wearer meets the Prerequisite: "not applied to the crafter, but the wearer".
[passive]
if (personality.score >= 4) {
  skill.$choice += 2;
}
